  "description": {
    "text": "McDonald's first Pokémon card campaign in Japan, in January and February 2002: one card to an opaque sealed pack with each Happy Meal. The five cards, Pikachu 021/P, Wooper 022/P, Tyrogue 023/P, Zapdos 024/P and Umbreon 025/P, are alternate-art versions of cards from The Town on No Map, the e-Card set released that March, with McDonald's logo beside the promo star. The promotion ran alongside McDonald's Original Minimum★Pack, a small booster sold at the restaurants.",
